  (text "NOTES\nC24: hot-loop cap: closest to VIN/GND\nU7: FCCM fixed 1.2 MHz (RT=GND); EN abs max 6 V -> open-drain pull-down only\nC26: soft start ~3.2 ms\nR21: Vout = 0.8 V x (1 + 31.6/10) = 3.33 V\nC29: optional feed-forward\nR22: INA226 #2 shunt, upstream of every socket bulk cap\nU8: I2C 0x41 (A0=VS, A1=GND): HaLow card current\nC31: pi-filter input cap\nFB1: verify rating at BOM step: >=4 A, <=30 mOhm\nJP1: cut to isolate the HaLow card rail\nR23: EN pull-up 0.7 uA: Pi off -> EN 0.07 V < 1.1 V off; on -> 3.3 + 0.21 V < 6 V abs max\nC32: EN has only a 0.7 uA pull-up: noise immunity" (at 15 105.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 00df80b0-8544-51b2-bcf3-3d83b000bff1))
